        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Forman, Arturo Ripstein, Colleen Moore\n- Films: April Showers, The Castle of Purity\n- Roles: actor, director, writer, producer\n- Topics: American silent film, Mexican cinema\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Forman was born on February 22, 1893, and he died on November 7, 1926.\n- Tom Forman was an American motion picture actor, director, writer, and producer of the early 1920s.\n- April Showers is a 1923 American silent romantic film directed by Tom Forman and starring Colleen Moore.\n- Arturo Ripstein y Rosen was born on December 13, 1943.\n- Arturo Ripstein is a Mexican film director.\n- The Castle of Purity, Spanish title \"El castillo de la pureza,\" is a 1972 Mexican drama film directed by Arturo Ripstein.",
